  "source_fixes": [
    "TObjChara stores typed base and attack pointers, and its get_stats method returns the native stat record under the original linked name.",
    "The player embeds base, attack and resistance records at the verified 0xD38, 0xD5C and 0xD8C offsets. Save, trade, item and status consumers use the corresponding fields.",
    "Actor and NPC stat initialization and recalculation read typed records and write their owning actor fields. The equipment and class previews share the native parameter contracts."
  ],
  "code_generation_decisions": [
    "The capped meseta increment keeps its existing memory view to preserve its exact instruction sequence. The shared spend path uses the native player_stats field.",
    "The existing attack-query return declarations and their compiler-sensitive equip callers were preserved after checking the attempted consolidation."
  ],
